    reviewQuestions: ["B\u1EA1n \u0111ang m\xF4 t\u1EA3 tri\u1EC7u ch\u1EE9ng hay \u0111ang t\u1EF1 g\xE1n nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n?", "C\xF3 m\u1EABu l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i qua nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n kh\xF4ng?", "D\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u n\xE0o y\xEAu c\u1EA7u d\u1EEBng th\u1EED v\xE0 \u0111i kh\xE1m?"]
